WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.641
Learn to code without installing anything?

2
00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:05.807
Pick a learning path in your browser.

3
00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:10.854
Each step has small tasks that are checked automatically.

4
00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:15.950
If you get stuck, you get a hint first, not the solution.

5
00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:20.350
Choose your path and click Open. You need an account for this.
